{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis version has been restructured for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scenes and expressions have been adjusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For information about other versions, please refer to the developer's official website or related channels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/3893596757109e9734be9f7772a17f5f.poster.avif?t=1756222033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/3893596757109e9734be9f7772a17f5f.webm?t=1756222033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/3893596757109e9734be9f7772a17f5f.mp4?t=1756222033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'AI-deal-Rays' is a high-speed 3D stage-clear action game where you control the full-intelligence android &quot;AI-deal&quot; in battle. Engage in combat against enemy androids and large-scale weapons while unfolding a story set in the year 2200.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've eliminated the complex operations typical of 3D action games, optimizing for smooth playability for everyone. At the same time, you can enjoy a variety of combat actions:\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirage Line</strong>: A special evasive maneuver that allows instantaneous movement behind enemies.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cluster Drain</strong>: An offensive and defensive technique that absorbs HP from enemies.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stray Dash</strong>: A high-speed attack that charges at enemies from mid-range.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sonic Burst</strong>: A powerful special move.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with keyboard/mouse or gamepad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anime-Style Presentation and Camera Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/054455c4d831a7d7b555366bc5286fd6.poster.avif?t=1756222033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/054455c4d831a7d7b555366bc5286fd6.webm?t=1756222033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/054455c4d831a7d7b555366bc5286fd6.mp4?t=1756222033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike fixed TPS perspectives, the camera dynamically moves like in anime, featuring numerous action-packed scenes. Special actions include cut-ins that highlight character expressions and mech details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Event Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/4c0e3ecc0f2fc51c40e0f1b52e90c354.avif?t=1756222033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras_big/4c0e3ecc0f2fc51c40e0f1b52e90c354.avif?t=1756222033 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between action sequences, event scenes are inserted to lead into the action. Enjoy a boy-meets-girl story set in the year 2200, featuring various sub-characters.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2200. Full-intelligence androids known as the &quot;Re;ON Series&quot; quietly begin their battles after finding their respective owners. During this time, the protagonist encounters TYPE-X2 &quot;AI-deal.&quot;\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How should we confront AIs that have reached a level capable of guiding humanity? We still don't know the answer...\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sub-Characters</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/ae55ef22775011dc94e9050c0e6c54ce.avif?t=1756222033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras_big/ae55ef22775011dc94e9050c0e6c54ce.avif?t=1756222033 width=800 height=448 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The androids that appear in battles and events each have unique visuals and personalities, standing in the player's way.\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Re;ON Type-X1 &quot;Ray-Ared&quot;\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Re;ON Type-R5 &quot;Accurate&quot;\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Re;ON Type-R6 &quot;Vita&quot;\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other boss-class androids are also planned to appear.\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, various sub-characters and enemy androids will appear to enhance the story.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Volume</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total of 10 chapters.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter includes: 2 action stages + 4 event scenes.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 5\u20136 hours (standard playthrough).\u200b</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You meet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620780/2a4658f7b203f94ff71d3562e8ac1ab0a7eb7e78.jp