<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've eliminated the complex operations typical of 3D action games, optimizing for smooth playability for everyone. At the same time, you can enjoy a variety of combat actions:\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirage Line</strong>: A special evasive maneuver that allows instantaneous movement behind enemies.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cluster Drain</strong>: An offensive and defensive technique that absorbs HP from enemies.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stray Dash</strong>: A high-speed attack that charges at enemies from mid-range.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sonic Burst</strong>: A powerful special move.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with keyboard/mouse or gamepad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anime-Style Presentation and Camera Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/054455c4d831a7d7b555366bc5286fd6.poster.avif?t=1756222033\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/054455c4d831a7d7b555366bc5286fd6.webm?t=1756222033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/extras/054455c4d831a7d7b555366bc5286fd6.mp4?t=1756222033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike fixed TPS perspectives, the camera dynamically moves like in anime, featuring numerous action-packed scenes. Special actions include cut-ins that highlight character expressions and mech details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Event Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta