ters and enemy androids will appear to enhance the story.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Volume</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total of 10 chapters.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter includes: 2 action stages + 4 event scenes.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 5\u20136 hours (standard playthrough).\u200b</p></li></ul>","developers":["Riez-ON"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620780/e2249861e3f1f368ad88fb13ee9e570c7ea4a207/header.jpg?t=1756222033","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620780/881503606/ddf74a153380a8cfb6448018b0ab371f28d529db/1755225715/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755230563","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620780/881503606/ddf74a153380a8cfb6448018b0ab371f28d529db/1755225715/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755230563","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620780/881503606/ddf74a153380a8cfb6448018b0ab371f28d529db/1755225715/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755230563","id":257183467,"name":"PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183467/28b788f48da8a15dea23d31365b942a15d7beb70/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755230563"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620780/858185/671d092d091f0a1ec6e02daa313ad911c68179d4/1750454884/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743588260","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620780/858185/671d092d091f0a1ec6e02daa313ad911c68179d4/1750454884/